    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "Some reactions take place instantly, but most are much slower and it is possible to measure how long these reactions take to reach a certain stage",
    "reading_order" : 4,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000005",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "As a chemical reaction proceeds, the concentration of the reactants decreases and the concentration of the products increases",
    "reading_order" : 5,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000006",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The **rate of a reaction **is the speed at which a chemical reaction takes place and has units **mol dm**<sup>**-3 **</sup>**s**<sup>**-1**</sup>",
    "reading_order" : 6,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000007",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The rate of a reaction can be calculated by:",
    "reading_order" : 7,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000008",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "Rate of reaction = $\\frac{\\mathrm{change} \\mathrm{in} \\mathrm{amount} \\mathrm{of} \\mathrm{reactants} \\mathrm{or} \\mathrm{products}(\\mathrm{mol} \\mathrm{dm}^{-3})}{\\mathrm{time}(s)}$",
    "reading_order" : 8,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "paragraph",
